105:  * <p>
106:  * The handler checks for the presence of a {@link Context#getPathTokens() path token} to indicate the name of an individual check to execute.
107:  * By default, the token is named {@value #DEFAULT_NAME_TOKEN}.
108:  * If a path token is present, but indicates the name of a non-existent health check, a {@code 404} {@link Context#clientError(int) client error} will be raised.
